    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaotic cooperative space simulator where four players control captains in a specific role. Unfortunately, the space corp you are a part is limited in operational space, so each captain much share their instruments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are four roles to specialize in: Helm, Communications, Engineering, and Weapons. Each role serves a purpose in proper operation of a Starship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your panel at anytime can be covered by another player, so you must work together and communicate effectively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine for materials, take on objectives, destroy other ships, or just joyride your ship. Your imagination is the limiting factor.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaotic cooperative space simulator where four players control captains in a specific role. Unfortunately, the space corp you are a part is limited in operational space, so each captain much share their instruments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are four roles to specialize in: Helm, Communications, Engineering, and Weapons. Each role serves a purpose in proper operation of a Starship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your panel at anytime can be covered by another player, so you must work together and communicate effectively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine for materials, take on objectives, destroy other ships, or just joyride your ship. Your imagination is the limiting factor.</p>",
